  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd4fd2b2e146cdf4cb93cae220eefad4, type: 3}
  m_Name: HowToPlay
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VXMonster.Tutorial.TutorialSequenceDefinition
  sequenceId: HowToPlay
  steps:
  - stepId: howtoplay
    title: How to Play
    body: 'Move with the joystick. Attacks fire on their own.


      Collect XP
      gems to level up and pick abilities. Active and passive slots fill as you build.


      Combine
      Burn, Chill, and Shock for combo bursts.


      Chests drop gold and relics
      (3 slots). Relics change the whole run.


      Campaign plays stages. Daily
      Challenge is a scored day seed. Endless loops and scales.


      Pick Easy
      / Normal / Hard / Nightmare before Campaign or Endless.


      Gold buys lobby
      upgrades. Boss kills feed the talent tree. Codex tracks relics, evolutions,
      and combos.'
